UPDATE companies SET description='Vermont Custom Handrails & Metalwork operates from a fabrication shop in Hyde Park, Vermont. The company was founded in 2021 by James Lambert, a master fabricator with more than twenty years of specialized metalworking experience. Lambert started the business to work directly with homeowners and architects, translating structural requirements into custom architectural centerpieces.

The shop produces custom stair and railing systems for both residential and commercial projects. Capabilities include floating stairs, wood-framed and steel-framed staircases, stainless steel handrail and cable railing systems, spiral staircases, and ADA-compliant railings. Every component is custom-fabricated on site using high-grade stainless steel by a team whose combined fabrication experience exceeds sixty years. The company also offers turnkey packages that cover design, fabrication, and installation, along with optional LED lighting integrated into handrails and monorail stairs.

Clients range from private homeowners building lakefront retreats and mountain lodges to architects and commercial contractors needing code-compliant railing systems. The firm serves Vermont, New Hampshire, New York, and the wider New England region, and has completed more than four hundred projects since inception.

Lambert emphasizes a collaborative process that begins with an in-home consultation, proceeds through custom design and fabrication, and ends with a clean installation and rigorous safety inspection. The company positions its blend of heavy-duty engineering and clean, modern lines as a differentiator, aiming to deliver structurally sound, visually striking results that are tailored to each space.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom stair system fabrication", "Stainless steel handrail fabrication", "Cable railing system fabrication", "Spiral staircase fabrication", "ADA-compliant railing fabrication", "Custom design and engineering", "In-home consultation and site measurement", "Installation of stair and railing systems", "Safety inspection and certification", "LED lighting integration for railings and stairs", "Turnkey project management"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Architectural metalwork", "ADA compliance contracting", "Home renovation and remodeling"], "materials": ["High-grade stainless steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Turnkey stair and railing packages from design through installation", "In-home consultation with site measurement and design collaboration", "Custom fabrication in Hyde Park, VT shop using high-grade stainless steel", "LED lighting options including cascading and handrail-integrated systems", "Team with combined 60+ years of metal fabrication experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2021 by James Lambert -> /", "Headquartered in Hyde Park, Vermont -> /", "Custom fabrication shop in Hyde Park, VT -> /", "Services: custom stairs, stainless steel handrails, cable railings, spiral staircases, ADA railings -> /", "Serves residential and commercial customers in Vermont, New Hampshire, New York, New England -> /", "400+ projects completed -> /", "Team with combined 60+ years fabrication experience -> /", "Turnkey stair and