UPDATE companies SET description='Virginia Steel & Fabrication operates from Bastian, Virginia, in the Appalachian region. The company was founded in 1992 on principles of craftsmanship and customer-focused service, with a focus on showing up to do the job right. No founders are named and ownership structure is not disclosed.

