UPDATE companies SET description='Voyager Electronics Corporation is based in Minneapolis, Minnesota, and was founded in 1982. The company operates as a distributor of electronic components and a manufacturer of cable-related solutions.

The company supplies a broad range of components including circuit protection devices, switches, connectors, power supplies, capacitors, and audio products. In 1997, Voyager established Best Source Electronics Corporation to produce custom cable assemblies, wire harnesses, and provide kitting, custom labeling, and other value-added services. Voyager also offers assembly, engineering, testing, kitting, EDI, and just-in-time delivery programs to reduce customer lead times and inventory.

Voyager serves customers in industrial, medical, aerospace, defense, automotive, IoT, automation, and agriculture sectors. Its client base includes manufacturers of telecom equipment and industrial electrical products. The company partners with component brands such as ZEUS Battery Products, Allied Components, Switch Components Inc., Tenergy Corporation, and Curtis Industries.

Voyager emphasizes value creation through supply-chain consolidation — fewer purchase orders, reduced expediting, and lower packaging waste — and through engineering collaboration on custom solutions such as modified LED displays or medical-grade power supplies. The company maintains ISO 9001:2015 certification and adheres to REACH and conflict-minerals policies.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cable assembly", "Wire harness manufacturing", "Custom component solutions", "Kitting", "Custom labeling", "Assembly", "Engineering design and prototype evaluation", "Continuity testing", "Visual inspection", "Traceability", "EDI integration", "Just-in-time delivery"], "industries": ["Industrial", "Medical", "Aerospace", "Defense", "Automotive", "IoT", "Automation", "Agriculture", "Telecommunications", "Industrial Electrical"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Value-added assembly and kitting that consolidates purchase orders, reduces expediting, and cuts packaging waste", "Custom engineering for modifications (e.g., LED displays, medical power supplies) with prototype evaluation and test", "In-house testing including continuity checks, custom fixtures, visual inspection, and traceability", "Just-in-time delivery programs aligned to customer production schedules", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1982 -> db", "Headquarters Minneapolis, Minnesota -> db", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /quality", "Industries served: Industrial, Medical, Aerospace, Defense, Automotive, IoT, Automation, Agriculture -> /", "Founded Best Source Electronics Corporation in 1997 for cable assemblies and wire harnesses -> /about-us", "Services: Assembly, Engineering, Testing, Kitting, EDI, JIT -> /services", "Products: circuit protection, switches, connectors, power supplies, capacitors, audio products -> /", "Partners: ZEUS Battery Products, Alli