UPDATE companies SET description='Westfield Sheet Metal Works, Inc. operates from Kenilworth, New Jersey, where it has been in business since 1928. The company began as a union shop affiliated with Sheet Metal Workers Union Local 22 and remains a union-affiliated fabricator. No individual founders are named in the available records.

The firm provides custom metal fabrication from design through installation, handling projects that range from small machine guards to 10‑foot‑by‑10‑foot plenums requiring crane lifts. Its 50,000‑square‑foot manufacturing and office facility sits on a 100,000‑square‑foot lot and is equipped for shearing, bending, welding, polishing, painting, quality control, and delivery. Engineering and project management teams guide each job from initial sketch or CAD drawing to final shipment.

Westfield serves architectural, commercial, construction, manufacturing, and historic‑restoration markets. Completed projects include the Streicker Bridge, light pylons for Gantry Plaza, Hunters Point South Park, Madison Square Garden, and Hunts Point Landing. The shop also produces custom stainless‑steel components for concession trailers and replicates historic window parts for landmark buildings.

The company emphasizes end‑to‑end control, with an in‑house engineering and project management staff that oversees every step from design to installation. Customers cite the firm’s dedication to quality service, on‑time and on‑budget delivery, and the ability to handle both one‑off and repeat production work.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "Shearing", "Bending", "Welding", "Polishing", "Painting", "Quality control", "Delivery", "Design", "Installation", "Project management", "Engineering", "CAD/CAM"], "industries": ["Architectural", "Commercial", "Construction", "Manufacturing", "Processing", "Historic restoration"], "materials": ["Stainless steel", "Copper"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Union-affiliated shop with Sheet Metal Workers Union Local 22", "50,000 sq ft facility on 100,000 sq ft lot", "In-house engineering and project management from design to installation", "Project scale from small guards to 10'' x 10'' plenums with crane lifts", "Experienced staff and skilled tradesmen handling all project sizes"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1928 -> db, /about-us", "Location Kenilworth, NJ -> /about-us, /", "Union shop Local 22 -> /about-us", "Facility size 50,000 sq ft on 100,000 sq ft lot -> /about-us", "Processes: shearing, bending, welding, polishing, painting, quality control, delivery -> /about-us", "Engineering and project management team -> /about-us", "Project scale: smallest guard to largest 10''x10'' plenum with crane lift -> /about-us", "Industries: architectural, commercial, other -> / (project categories)", "Specific projects: Streicker Bridge, Light Pylons, Gantry Plaza, Hunters Point South Park, Madison Square Garden, Hunts Point Landing -> /", "Historic window restoration customer -> /about-us", "Concession trailer custom stainless steel -> /about-us", "Customer testimonial about Tom & Gregg -> /about-us", "Materials: stainless steel, copper -> /a