UPDATE companies SET description='Westmoreland Plastics Co operates from Latrobe, Pennsylvania, where it has been producing custom thermoset and thermoplastic molded components for more than fifty years.

The company manufactures thermoset and thermoplastic molded parts and sub-assemblies, offering in-house tooling design and build as well as the ability to run customer-supplied molds. Its value-added services include lapping and fine grinding to meet precise dimensional requirements.

