UPDATE companies SET description='White Sands Woodworks operates from Alamogordo, New Mexico, near White Sands National Park and Holloman Air Force Base. The company was established in 2014 by Karl Peter, a German native who spent nearly three decades in the German Air Force before retiring to pursue a lifelong passion for woodworking and blacksmithing. The business is family operated and blends German craftsmanship traditions with American practicality, rooted in Karl’s early years restoring antique furniture alongside his father in Germany.

Customers span active-duty and retired military personnel seeking commemorative gifts, homeowners ordering bespoke furniture and décor, and businesses needing custom pieces for office or retail settings. Reviews highlight projects such as an overnight plaque for a ceremony, restoration of a century-old oak table, and a precision acrylic component for a planetary model installed in Alamogordo.

The company emphasizes a fusion of old-world craftsmanship and current technology, positioning itself as a source for heirloom-quality items tailored to each client’s vision. Karl Peter’s background in antique restoration and his dedication to the craft are cited as the foundation for the business’s focus on quality, artistry, and personal service.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom woodworking", "Blacksmithing", "Laser cutting and engraving", "Epoxy table fabrication", "Furniture making", "Cabinetry", "Knife making", "Metal fabrication", "Antique furniture restoration", "Custom military displays (challenge coin holders, flag cases, shadow boxes)"], "industries": ["Military / defense (commemorative gifts)", "Home decor and furnishings", "Custom furniture", "Personalized gifts", "Business / corporate custom pieces"], "materials": ["Weathered wood", "Birch (laser cut)", "African exotic woods", "Epoxy resin", "Turquoise and other stones", "Acrylic", "Steel", "Iron", "Cherry wood", "Oak"], "equipment": ["Laser cutter/engraver"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family operated, blending German and American craftsmanship traditions", "Custom pieces tailored for military, business, and personal settings", "Combination of old-world handwork and modern laser cutting/engraving", "Fast turnaround on select items (e.g., overnight plaque)", "Founder\u2019s background in antique restoration and German Air Force service"], "facts_used": ["Location: Alamogordo, New Mexico -> /about", "Founded 2014 by Karl Peter after German Air Force career -> /about", "Family operated business blending German and American cultures -> /about", "Specializes in custom woodworking, blacksmithing, laser engraving, epoxy tables -> /, /about", "Products: cutting boards, furniture, cabinetry, knives, military displays -> /", "Materials: weathered wood, birch, African exotic woods, epoxy, turquoise, acrylic, steel, iron -> /", "Serves militar