UPDATE companies SET description='WhyGen Solar was founded in 2020 in Rio Rancho, New Mexico, during the COVID-19 pandemic. CEO Aaron Rice started the company after recognizing a gap in the solar industry: most firms prioritized profits over their sales force. Rice, influenced by Simon Sinek''s "Start With Why," built the business around the idea that supporting sales representatives leads to better customer outcomes.

The company provides residential and commercial solar installation services across New Mexico, Arizona, and Colorado. Its offerings include direct purchase, loan financing, and lease or power-purchase agreements, each backed by warranties covering parts, labor, and in some cases system production.

The customer base spans homeowners seeking to reduce utility bills and businesses aiming for sustainable energy. The company cites its BBB A+ rating in the Southwest Region as a marker of service quality.

