UPDATE companies SET description='Wire Me Electric Inc. is an electrical contracting firm based in Sparks, Nevada, serving the Reno–Lake Tahoe region. The company was founded in 2006 by Ben (last name not disclosed) and Christine Matlock, who serves as vice president and co-owner. According to the company’s about page, the pair started the business to gain the freedom of their own operation and to be at the forefront of innovative electrical contracting for custom homes, leveraging Ben’s established reputation in the Truckee and Tahoe areas. Matt Burns, who also owns the local franchise of Outdoor Lighting Perspectives, holds the title of chief operating officer.

