UPDATE companies SET description='World Class Plastics Inc operates from Russells Point, Ohio. It specializes in plastic injection molding and related services.

The company runs injection molding machines with clamping forces from 50 to 720 metric tons, supported by Yushin multi-axis servo robots and Shinwa Aeroboy degating robots for automation. Its in-house tooling department handles mold maintenance, repair, design changes, and production support. Engineering services are led by RJG Master Molder II certified engineers using SolidWorks. Value-added operations include assembly, pad printing, ultrasonic welding, insert molding, and decorating, while chrome plating and painting are outsourced to qualified suppliers. Automation cells feature Yushin traverse robots, automated degating stations, and custom assembly stations with feeder bowls and pick-and-place robots.

World Class Plastics serves appliance, automotive, aviation and aerospace, clips and fasteners, dental, electrical, multi-industry gears, industrial, and medical markets. It is a Worthington Industries certified supplier.

The company emphasizes tight-tolerance molding, professional color matching, and real-time process monitoring via the Synergy 2000 SPC system and RJG e-Dart pressure transducers. Quality is managed under ISO 9001:2015 with inspection equipment including an OGP Z600 video measuring system, a Mitutoyo Crysta Apex CMM, and a BYK-Gardner spectrophotometer.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection molding (50\u2013720 metric tons)", "Engineering & design (SolidWorks, RJG Master Molder II)", "Tool & mold building (maintenance, repair, design changes, production support)", "Pad printing", "Ultrasonic welding", "Insert molding", "Assembly services", "Decorating", "Chrome plating (external)", "Painting (external)", "Automation: Yushin traverse robots", "Automated degating stations", "Custom assembly stations with feeder bowls and pick-and-place robots", "Color matching", "Material selection guidance", "Real-time quality monitoring (Synergy 2000 SPC, RJG e-Dart)", "Advanced inspection (CMM, video measuring, spectrophotometer)"], "industries": ["Appliance", "Automotive", "Aviation & Aerospace", "Clips & Fasteners", "Dental", "Electrical", "Multi-Industry Gears", "Industrial", "Medical"], "materials": ["Acrylic", "ABS", "Acetal", "Nylon", "Polycarbonate", "Polypropylene"], "equipment": ["Injection molding machines (50\u2013720 metric tons)", "Yushin multi-axis servo robots", "Shinwa Aeroboy degating robots", "OGP Z600 fully automated video measuring system (24\" x 18\" stage)", "Mitutoyo Crysta Apex Series C700 CMM (28\" x 28\" x 24\" measuring area)", "BYK-Gardner handheld spectrophotometer", "MacBeth Light Booth \u2013 Spectralight III", "Synergy 2000 SPC System", "RJG e-Dart data acquisition with pressure transducers", "Sumitomo injection molding machines", "Yushin traverse robots", "Automated degating stations", "Custom assembly stations with feeder bowls and pick-and-place robots"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": 